## Categories to cover for each feature

- [ ] Happy path for every BDD scenario
- [ ] Validation errors (each rule in the AC)
- [ ] Permissions: {{roles}} × {{environments}} — including a direct API call that must return `403`
- [ ] UI states: loading, empty (no data vs no match), error + retry, populated
- [ ] Boundaries: empty, first/last page, limits
- [ ] External failures: {{providers}} timeout / error (stubbed and labelled)
- [ ] Repeated submit / concurrent edit where relevant
- [ ] Out-of-scope guard: nothing from "scope out" implemented
- [ ] Regression: {{regression_areas}}

## Case format

```
<CASE-ID>  (covers <AC-ID> | regression | out-of-scope guard)   priority <P1|P2|P3>   level <api | ui | visual | manual>
Given:  <data and state, with its source>
When:   <action, as user or API caller>
Then:   <observable result: screen / message / persisted data / status code>
Target: <environment, route or endpoint, role>
```

## Priority

P1 — {{p1_areas}} · P2 — validation, states, regression · P3 — cosmetic, rare edges. Run P1 first.

